  "{0}: no ar, mas responder pelo escrit\xF3rio est\xE1 desligado (porta exposta na rede ou HABBLAUD_TERMINAL=0).": "{0}: up, but answering from the office is off (port exposed on the network or HABBLAUD_TERMINAL=0).",
