  "Habblaud World desligado: HABBLAUD_WORLD_URL recusada (veja o log do servidor)": "Habblaud World d\xE9sactiv\xE9\u202F: HABBLAUD_WORLD_URL refus\xE9e (voir le journal du serveur)",
